#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometryinstance3d.rst:21 e1d5b593f4034c9a8c41840da7e48ec8
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometryinstance3d.rst:23 228d763123b648c3aa8cd3939e4d5067
msgid ""
"FmodGeometryInstance3D creates an FMOD Geometry object from child "
":ref:`CollisionShape3D<class_CollisionShape3D>` nodes, a selected "
":ref:`MeshInstance3D<class_MeshInstance3D>`, or a :ref:`Mesh<class_Mesh>` resource. It is "
"designed to be placed in the scene as a solid audio occluder: add this node, add collision shapes"
" below it, then tune direct and reverb occlusion in the Inspector."
msgstr ""
"**FmodGeometryInstance3D**    用于将场景中的几何体注册到 FMOD Geometry 系统，让 3D 声音可以根据场景遮挡产生直达声和混响遮挡 （参见   "
":ref:`CollisionShape3D<class_CollisionShape3D>`  ） （参见   "
":ref:`MeshInstance3D<class_MeshInstance3D>`  ） （参见   :ref:`Mesh<class_Mesh>`  ）"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometryinstance3d.rst:23 612837306622403b95c8cc9abdcd3905
msgid "The node keeps the FMOD geometry transform synchronized with its global transform at runtime."
msgstr "该节点在运行时将全局变换同步到 FMOD 几何体。"

